          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "S0063",
          "index": 63,
          "start_offset": 606,
          "end_offset": 636,
          "text": "## 6）液限 $\\omega_{\\mathrm{L}}$\n"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "S0064",
          "index": 64,
          "start_offset": 636,
          "end_offset": 637,
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "S0065",
          "index": 65,
          "start_offset": 637,
          "end_offset": 674,
          "text": "土由可塑状态转为流体状态时的界限含水率为液性上限，称为液性界限，简称液限。"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "S0066",
